Song: Jesus, You're Beautiful
Artist: Nate Sabin (rec.by Cece Winans, Sara Groves)
Key: Bb

Verse:
 [Bb2]     Jesus,     bright as [Gm7]the morning star.
 [Cm9]     Jesus,     how can I [Eb/F]tell [F/Eb]You how
[Bb2/D]beautiful You [Eb]are [Bb/Eb]to [Fsus]me.     [F7]

[Bb2]      Jesus,     song that the [Gm7]angels sing.
[Cm9]      Jesus,     dearer to [Eb/F]my [F/Eb]heart than [Bb2/D]any[Eb]thing.
[Bb/F]Sweeter than [Cm/F]spring-[Bb/F]time
[Am7b5]purer than [Dsus]sun-[D7]shine
[Gm7]ever my [Ab/Bb]song [Bb7]will [Ebmaj9]be      [G/Eb]  [Cm/Eb]

[Bb/F]Jesus You're [Cm/F]beau-[Bb/F]ti-[Fsus]ful  [F] to [Bb2]me   [Cm9][F7]

*Chorus: 
(ad lib singing his attributes)
[Bb2]Beautiful  (Beautiful)
[Cm9]Beautiful  (Beautiful)
[Bb2/D]Beautiful  (Beautiful)
[Cm/Eb]Jesus, You're [Ebmaj9/F]beauti[F7]-ful to me

Wonderful....

Morning star....

